{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "40d7b82e-4148-8daa-93fb-e068f626cc7c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-20T15:53:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yuki Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:50:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. This is Yuki Nguyen. I know it's Saturday and City Hall's closed, so I'm calling the storm line like the recording said."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:50:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:50:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a big puddle of water across the crosswalk by the school bus stop, right near my house. It's from that soaker that ended Thursday, two days ago, and it's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:50:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, and where exactly are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "135 Kay Street, up on the Hill. The crosswalk's just down from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:51:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 135 Kay Street. How deep is the water, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps on a car, I'd say. I watched one go through and it threw a wave."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:51:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, okay. Writing that down, hubcap deep, crosswalk, Kay Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:51:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the kids wait there for the bus. They can't get around it on the curb, so they're stepping out into the road to go around. With cars coming. I don't like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's not good. Is it a drain that's blocked, do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has to be. The grate's down at the low spot and it's all leaves and mush on top of it. Water's not going anywhere. So I'd like the drain cleaned out, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:51:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put in a request to get a crew to clean that drain and flag the bus stop. I can't tell you the exact time they'll get there, they've been busy since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Just so it's on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the list. Do you want a callback number on the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0183, got it. Anything else down there, any water near houses, or just the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the crosswalk. My cellar's fine. It's just the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then I've got it all. Crosswalk by the bus stop, hubcap deep, drain needs cleaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Say, are you warm enough in that office today? Somebody told me the heat's iffy in some of those buildings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm all right, thanks for asking. I've got a space heater under the desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Keep it on, then. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:52:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Nguyen. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T15:53:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
